---
title: Casting and mana
pageSlug: casting-and-mana
mod: spell-codex-ars-compat
section: gameplay
order: 3
---

Once converted, Ars cards live in [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex) and cast from [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar) like any other unlocked spell.

- Icons use the form glyph with the first effect overlaid.
- The spell’s name and description match the tome.
- Codex’s spell inspector and scroll tooltips list every glyph in the recipe.
- Mana cost is the Ars recipe cost, paid as **Iron’s mana**. Ars source is not spent. There is no Iron’s cooldown.
- Casting runs the original Ars sequence (projectile, touch, self, linger, and so on).
- Ars spells can be removed from the Codex with the inspector **Remove** button.
